WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
It really impacts a person's language and communication.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:10,060
So as the disease progresses, people start to forget words, you know, commonly used words.

3
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:16,660
In my case, for example, my mother was Finnish and she would start mixing up Finnish and English in the same sentence.

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:23,260
So as it progresses more and more, they really have a hard time putting together sentences.
